Academic, non-commercial research license
========================================

Copyright (c) 2026 Berk Can Acikgoz and collaborators
Department of Diagnostic, Interventional and Pediatric Radiology (DIPR),
Inselspital, Bern University Hospital, University of Bern

This repository provides MATLAB code for proton-density fat fraction (PDFF)
mapping from phase-cycled bSSFP, including ΔB0 estimation with graph cuts
and SPARCQ dictionary matching.

