This repository includes graph-cut fat–water imaging code created at the
University of Wisconsin by Diego Hernando. That code is licensed to academic
researchers under the University of Wisconsin Academic Software End User
License Agreement for fat-water imaging software. The original agreement is
not redistributed with this repository.

In summary, that agreement grants a non-commercial, non-transferable,
