Please cite the graph-cut method and the ISMRM Fat-Water Toolbox as described
in README.md.


matlab_bgl
----------

The min-cut/max-flow solver used by the graph-cut code is matlab_bgl
(Copyright David Gleich / Stanford University), which includes compiled
object code from the Boost Graph Library (Boost Software License 1.0).
